{'symbol': 'ACN', 'date': '2022-11-30 00:01:00', 'title': 'COMPANIES WITH HIGHLY INTEROPERABLE TECHNOLOGY ACHIEVE SIX TIMES HIGHER REVENUE GROWTH, ACCORDING TO NEW ACCENTURE RESEARCH', 'text': 'NEW YORK--( BUSINESS WIRE )--NEW RESEARCH FROM ACCENTURE (NYSE: ACN) FINDS THAT COMPANIES WITH HIGHLY INTEROPERABLE ENTERPRISE APPLICATIONS GAIN GREATER AGILITY TO THRIVE AMID UNCERTAINTY AND ACHIEVE STRONGER FINANCIAL PERFORMANCE. LAST YEAR, COMPANIES WITH HIGH INTEROPERABILITY – WHICH CONSIST OF ONE IN THREE COMPANIES SURVEYED (34%) – GREW REVENUE SIX TIMES FASTER THAN THEIR PEERS WITH LOW INTEROPERABILITY, AND THEY ARE POISED TO UNLOCK AN ADDITIONAL FIVE PERCENTAGE POINTS IN ANNUAL REVENUE GROWTH.'}